                    "email": null,
                    "website": "https://github.com/HellAholic"
                },
                "description": "This is a Multi-Quality Profile G-code Splicer. It allows you to print different sections of your model with different quality settings in a single print job. Want a fast draft quality for the base and fine details at the top? HellaFusion makes it possible.\n\nHow it works:\n- Define transition heights where you want to switch quality profiles\n- Assign a different Cura quality profile to each section\n- HellaFusion automatically slices each section and combines them into one seamless G-code file\n- Your printer executes a single print job with smooth transitions between quality settings",
                "display_name": "HellaFusion",
                "is_active": true,
